{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["כי קללת אלהים תלוי — when people see the hanged man they are prone to curse the judges or the relatives of the slain or other people, because sometimes he is killed for a minor offense, like the gatherer of wood, and the Holy One, blessed be He, said: לא תקלל — because people are prone to curse them, and therefore: לא תלין נבלתו — but rather קבר תקברנו — וגם שלא תטמא את אדמתך — for if he were not buried, those who touch or are shaded under him would be rendered impure by him."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:39:18.061675365Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}